lass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-logic.md\">../batch17/58-df-logic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order signature) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal candidate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure candidates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (typing predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (object-level semantics and universe operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\)</span> (isomorphism predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\)</span> (language-indexed model predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CategoricalTheory}_S(L,T,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CategoricalTheory}_S(L,T,\\kappa)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}model\\text{-}of\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}model\\text{-}of\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6CategoricalTheory}_S(L,T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Language}_S(L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl((\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\land\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal N,L,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=\\kappa\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|=\\kappa)\\to\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6CategoricalTheory}_S(L,T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Language}_S(L)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\;\\Bigl((\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal M,L,T)\\land\\operatorname{ModelOfTheory}_S(\\mathcal N,L,T)\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|=\\kappa\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)|=\\kappa)\\to\\exists f\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_S(f,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,L)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is categoricity in the cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>: at least one <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-sized model exists, and all such models are isomorphic. The existence conjunct blocks vacuous truth when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> has no model of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Theory satisfaction is witnessed by the registered <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> recursion and assignments; the formula no longer mixes an undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}_S\\)</span> spelling with unguarded metalinguistic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"01f4b76e2e096590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cardinalclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3838e99021ae044","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cardinalclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-logic.md","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-logic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends